WEBVTT

00:11:28.792 --> 00:11:33.476
And that means that once we have the will

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.083
and the resources to do it,

00:11:36.708 --> 00:11:38.726
this could be the generation

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:42.583
that stops feeling like racism
is an unsolvable problem

00:11:44.542 --> 00:11:46.059
and instead sees

00:11:46.083 --> 00:11:51.875
that what's been necessary
for far too long is possible.

00:11:52.875 --> 00:11:54.184
Thank you.

00:11:54.208 --> 00:11:58.458
(Applause and cheers)